      "source": [
        "# Atomic operation\n",
        "\n",
        "An atomic operation appears indivisible to other threads: they cannot observe it partially completed. Atomicity of individual operations does not make a sequence of operations atomic.\n",
        "\n",
        "Source: [Python glossary](https://docs.python.org/3/glossary.html#term-atomic-operation)"
      ]
    }
  ],
